# PyInstaller
#   Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#   before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec
# ...but Flutter's Windows runner manifest is not PyInstaller output — keep it.
!frontend/rtg-flutter-app/windows/runner/runner.exe.manifest

